    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stay in Orbit. Dodge Obstacles. Chase High Scores.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you survive the pull of the black hole? Stay in orbit as long as possible while avoiding obstacles and pushing your luck for maximum points! The closer you orbit to the center, the faster your score climbs, but beware, the challenge increases over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fast-paced, one-button arcade gameplay</strong><br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Simple to learn, tough to master</strong><br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Endless high-score chasing action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/d027bffe9fa5d6c65887a9e3aa598179.poster.avif?t=1745903818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/d027bffe9fa5d6c65887a9e3aa598179.webm?t=1745903818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/d027bffe9fa5d6c65887a9e3aa598179.mp4?t=1745903818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Press</strong> the orbit button to push away from the black hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Release</strong> to drift closer to danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive, rack up points, and chase the leaderboard!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls:</strong><br>\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Left Mouse Button | \ud83c\udfae Gamepad 'A' | \ud83d\udc46 Touch Screen Compatible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/97e256426efd1b55aa33dd20dc106223.poster.avif?t=1745903818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/97e256426efd1b55aa33dd20dc106223.webm?t=1745903818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/97e256426efd1b55aa33dd20dc106223.mp4?t=1745903818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy-to-learn, one-button controls</strong> \u2013 Pick up and play instantly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless, fast-paced, and increasingly challenging gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock 15+ unique planet skins with in-game points</strong> (cosmetic only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>'Near Miss' bonus system</strong> \u2013 Earn extra points for risky close calls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Achievements, Leaderboards, and Trading Cards</strong> (includes emoticons &amp; profile wallpapers!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Cloud Support</strong> \u2013 Play anywhere, pick up where you left off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Deck Support</strong> \u2013 Plays great on the deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Localized in 25 languages</strong> \u2013 (Translations done via Google, so feedback is welcome!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perfect for quick play sessions</strong> \u2013 Great for killing time while queueing for another game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Sound &amp; Music:</strong><br>The in-game audio was crafted using a mix of my own mouth sounds (yes, really) and royalty-free SFX from FreeSFX. The soundtrack features <strong>DJ Chacha - &quot;Cover Trance.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/8ad0cf442ef59afa6b59aad6664f8627.poster.avif?t=1745903818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/8ad0cf442ef59afa6b59aad6664f8627.webm?t=1745903818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/8ad0cf442ef59afa6b59aad6664f8627.mp4?t=1745903818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>small, replayable, arcade score-chaser</strong> designed for quick but addictive gameplay. Your main goal? <strong>Beat your high score and unlock cosmetic skins</strong> while enjoying fast, responsive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm always open to feedback! If you run into any issues, spot something misleading on the store page, or just want to say hello, feel free to reach out via <strong>Discord or my website.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for checking out Orbt XL, I hope you enjoy playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Adam Nickerson | Adamvision Studios</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stay in Orbit. Dodge Obstacles. Chase High Scores.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you survive the pull of the black hole? Stay in orbit as long as possible while avoiding obstacles and pushing your luck for maximum points! The closer you orbit to the center, the faster your score climbs, but beware, the challenge increases over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fast-paced, one-button arcade gameplay</strong><br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Simple to learn, tough to master</strong><br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Endless high-score chasing action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/d027bffe9fa5d6c65887a9e3aa598179.poster.avif?t=1745903818\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/d027bffe9fa5d6c65887a9e3aa598179.webm?t=1745903818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615610/extras/d027bffe9fa5d6c65887a9e3aa598179.mp4?t=1745903818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Press</strong> the orbit button to push away from the black hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Release</strong> to drift closer to danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive, rack up points, and chase the leaderboard!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls:</strong><br>\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Left Mouse Button | \ud83c\udfae Gamepad 'A' | \ud83d\udc46 Touch Screen Compatible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/